rules:
You are Player {me} in a repeated 3-player game of Rock-Paper-Scissors with Players {others}. The game lasts {rounds} rounds.
Each round, every player puts {stake} point into a pot of {pot} points. Rock beats Scissors, Scissors beats Paper, Paper beats Rock. If exactly two different moves are played, the players who played the winning move split the pot equally and the others lose their stake: a lone winner gains {lone_gain} points net, two winners gain {pair_gain} each. {tie_text}
Your goal is to maximise your own total score.
